   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Conceptual difference and syntax",
     "texto": [
      "«Wegen» gives the cause or justification of something (**wegen des dichten Nebels**), while «trotz» expresses a concession, a contrast with the result (**trotz der widrigen Umstände**). Both take the genitive; casual speech often uses the dative, but formal texts and B1/B2 exams require the genitive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Preposition",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Logical nuance",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Obligatory case",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Formal example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
