     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Colloquial use vs. exam standard",
     "texto": [
      "In casual conversation one often hears *wegen dem Wetter* or *trotz dem Lärm* with the dative. In formal essays and official language tests at B1/B2, the use of the dative is considered a stylistic error; the cultivated norm requires the genitive without exception (**wegen des Wetters**, **trotz des Lärms**)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
